 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- v1 `Files.Add` now accepts a file name and `io.Reader`, builds the required
+  multipart body, and retains the legacy raw body/content-type call form.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- File uploads created by v1 `Files.Add` are replayable, so retry policies can
+  retry them after a 429 or other retryable response.
+
